' imported from i_lo.new.prg with:
'   tools/detok.sh (C64List4_04.exe -txt -keycase -varcase -alpha:alt)
' line numbers are kept as they were; jumps to lines in im (gosub 3, goto 5, ...)
' resolve through 3_0-preface.lbl. unchanged, this builds a program identical
' to the original, except that capitals in rem text are $61-$7a, not $c1-$da.

' redesign goals:
' 1) menu system like i/setup, allow user to review and edit answers
' 2) show graphic menu example, choose editor mode and U/D protocol, use sub.param1 perhaps?
' 3) line numbering at blocks of 100
' 4) use do-loop/exit or do...while, instr()
' 5) Sentence case, not headline case
' 6) Word wrap with lp=1:&"... " if continuing on next line
' what other config options are there for a new account... edit them too

{uses:..\3_0-preface.lbl}
{alpha:alt}

